msgid "al.copy"
msgstr "al.copy"

msgid "功能类似 copy_from_ub_to_l1 , 在 copy_from_ub_to_l1 的基础上增加了 ub 到 ub 的复制，原来的 copy_from_ub_to_l1 添加废弃警告。"
msgstr "The functionality is similar to `copy_from_ub_to_l1`, with the addition of copying from ub to ub on the basis of `copy_from_ub_to_l1`. The original `copy_from_ub_to_l1` has been marked with a deprecation warning."

msgid "Its functionality is similar to copy_from_ub_to_l1. Based on copy_from_ub_to_l1, it adds support for UB-to-UB copying. The original copy_from_ub_to_l1 has been updated to include a deprecation warning."
msgstr "Its functionality is similar to copy_from_ub_to_l1. Based on copy_from_ub_to_l1, it adds support for UB-to-UB copying. The original copy_from_ub_to_l1 has been updated to include a deprecation warning."

msgid "参数"
msgstr "parameter"

msgid "返回值"
msgstr "Return Value"

msgid "无"
msgstr "None"

msgid "src 和 dst 必须同时为 tensor 或者 buffer ，tensor 暂时不支持"
msgstr "src and dst must both be tensors or buffers; tensors are not currently supported."

msgid "src 的address space 必须为UB， dst 的address space 必须为L1"
msgstr "The address space of `src` must be UB, and the address space of `dst` must be L1."

msgid "src 和 dst 类型 ，形状必须相同"
msgstr "The `src` and `dst` types and shapes must be the same."

msgid "al.copy_from_ub_to_l1 接口文档"
msgstr "al.copy_from_ub_to_l1 API Documentation"

msgid "1. 硬件背景"
msgstr "1. Hardware Background"

msgid "昇腾硬件 A5 支持了直接从 UB 复制数据到 L1 ， 避免了先从 UB 到 GM 再从 GM 到 L1 复制两次，可以提高数据复制的效率。 因此，提供 copy_from_ub_to_l1 接口实现数据从 UB 到 L1 的复制。"
msgstr "Ascend hardware A5 supports copying data directly from UB to L1, avoiding the two-step process of copying from UB to GM and then from GM to L1, thereby improving data copy efficiency. Therefore, the `copy_from_ub_to_l1` interface is provided to implement data copying from UB to L1."

msgid "支持VF手动同步"
msgstr "Support VF manual synchronization"

