msgstr "Each element of `shape` must be a positive integer."

msgid "需自行保证符合指定的地址空间上的大小限制"
msgstr "You must ensure compliance with the specified size limits on the given address space."

msgid "address_space参数默认为空，表示不携带任何地址空间信息"
msgstr "The `address_space` parameter defaults to empty, indicating that no address space information is carried."

