msgstr "`gridY`"

msgid "启动网格 Y 维度"
msgstr "Launch grid Y dimension"

msgid "`gridZ`"
msgstr "`gridZ`"

msgid "启动网格 Z 维度"
msgstr "Launch grid Z dimension"

msgid "`shapes_data`"
msgstr "`shapes_data`"

msgid "`const int64_t*`"
msgstr "`const int64_t*`"

msgid "各 tensor shape 按顺序拼接的一维展平数组。长度等于 `sum(shape_dims[i]) for i in 0..num_tensors-1`。主要用于 msprof tensor 信息上报，非 kernel 执行必需参数，可为 `nullptr`（此时 `shape_dims` 也应置空）"
msgstr "A one-dimensional flattened array formed by concatenating the shapes of each tensor in order. Its length equals `sum(shape_dims[i]) for i in 0..num_tensors-1`. It is mainly used for msprof tensor information reporting and is not a required parameter for kernel execution; it can be `nullptr` (in which case `shape_dims` should also be set to empty)."

msgid "`shape_dims`"
msgstr "`shape_dims`"

msgid "`const int*`"
msgstr "`const int*`"

msgid "每个 tensor 的维度数，数组长度 = `num_tensors`。与 `shapes_data` 配对使用；若 `shapes_data` 为 `nullptr` 则也应为 `nullptr`"
msgstr "The number of dimensions for each tensor, array length = `num_tensors`. Used in conjunction with `shapes_data`; if `shapes_data` is `nullptr`, this should also be `nullptr`."

msgid "`num_tensors`"
msgstr "`num_tensors`"

msgid "tensor 总数，同时决定 `shape_dims` 和 `tensor_kinds` 数组的有效长度"
msgstr "Total number of tensors, also determines the effective length of the `shape_dims` and `tensor_kinds` arrays."

msgid "`tensor_kinds`"
msgstr "`tensor_kinds`"

msgid "各 tensor 的类型标记，数组长度 = `num_tensors`。取值：`0` = INPUT，`1` = OUTPUT，`2` = INPUT_OUTPUT。主要用于 msprof tensor 分类上报；若为 `nullptr` 则默认按 INPUT 处理"
msgstr "Type markers for each tensor, array length = `num_tensors`. Values: `0` = INPUT, `1` = OUTPUT, `2` = INPUT_OUTPUT. Mainly used for msprof tensor classification reporting; if `nullptr`, it defaults to INPUT."

msgid "`kernel_args`"
msgstr "`kernel_args`"

msgid "`const void* const*`"
msgstr "`const void* const*`"

msgid "kernel 参数指针数组，每个元素指向一个 kernel 参数的起始地址，按 kernel 函数签名顺序一一对应。数组长度 = `num_args`。若 `num_args` 为 0 则可为 `nullptr`"
msgstr "kernel parameter pointer array, each element points to the starting address of a kernel parameter, corresponding one-to-one in the order of the kernel function signature. Array length = `num_args`. If `num_args` is 0, it can be `nullptr`."

msgid "`arg_sizes`"
msgstr "`arg_sizes`"

msgid "`const size_t*`"
msgstr "`const size_t*`"

msgid "各 kernel 参数的大小（字节），与 `kernel_args` 一一对应，数组长度 = `num_args`。若 `num_args` 为 0 则可为 `nullptr`"
msgstr "The size (in bytes) of each kernel parameter, corresponding one-to-one with `kernel_args`, with array length = `num_args`. If `num_args` is 0, it can be `nullptr`."

msgid "`num_args`"
msgstr "`num_args`"

msgid "kernel 参数个数。若 `num_args > 0` 但 `kernel_args` 或 `arg_sizes` 为 `nullptr`，函数将静默返回，不发射 kernel"
msgstr "Number of kernel arguments. If `num_args > 0` but `kernel_args` or `arg_sizes` is `nullptr`, the function will silently return without launching the kernel."

msgid "4. 参数内存布局与生命周期"
msgstr "4. Parameter Memory Layout and Lifecycle"

msgid "4.1 kernel_args 深拷贝"
msgstr "4.1 Deep copy of kernel_args"

msgid "函数内部会遍历 `kernel_args` 和 `arg_sizes`，将每个参数值 `memcpy` 到 `std::vector<std::vector<char>> copied_kernel_args` 本地容器中。因此："
msgstr "Inside the function, it iterates over `kernel_args` and `arg_sizes`, and `memcpy`s each argument value into a local container `std::vector<std::vector<char>> copied_kernel_args`. Therefore:"

msgid "**调用方在函数返回后可立即释放 `kernel_args` 中各指针指向的内存**，不影响发射"
msgstr "**The caller may free the memory pointed to by each pointer in `kernel_args` immediately after the function returns**, without affecting the launch."

msgid "深拷贝带来额外内存开销，开销大小 = `sum(arg_sizes[i])`"
msgstr "Deep copy introduces additional memory overhead, with the overhead size = `sum(arg_sizes[i])`."

msgid "4.2 launch_args 连续缓冲区布局"
msgstr "4.2 launch_args Contiguous Buffer Layout"

msgid "函数内部将所有发射参数组装到一段连续的 `std::vector<char> launch_args` 中，按以下顺序布局（各槽位按对齐要求偏移）："
msgstr "Inside the function, all launch parameters are assembled into a contiguous `std::vector<char> launch_args`, arranged in the following order (each slot is offset according to alignment requirements):"

msgid "**注意：** 此布局由 `generate_npu_wrapper_src()` 根据当前 kernel 的 signature、metadata、编译选项动态生成，不同编译产物的布局可能不同。"
msgstr "**Note:** This layout is dynamically generated by `generate_npu_wrapper_src()` based on the current kernel's signature, metadata, and compilation options. The layout may vary for different compilation artifacts."

msgid "4.3 workspace 与 syncBlockLock"
msgstr "4.3 workspace and syncBlockLock"

msgid "**workspace**：当 `metadata.workspace_size > 0` 时，函数内部通过 `allocate_memory` 分配 workspace，并以 `std::shared_ptr` 管理生命周期，函数返回时自动释放"
msgstr "**workspace**: When `metadata.workspace_size > 0`, the function internally allocates workspace via `allocate_memory` and manages its lifecycle with `std::shared_ptr`, automatically releasing it when the function returns."

msgid "**syncBlockLock**：当 `metadata.lock_num > 0` 时，函数内部通过 `allocate_sync_block_lock` 分配同步锁内存，初始化值为 `metadata.lock_init_value`，同样以 `std::shared_ptr` 管理生命周期"
msgstr "**syncBlockLock**: When `metadata.lock_num > 0`, the function internally allocates sync lock memory via `allocate_sync_block_lock`, with the initial value set to `metadata.lock_init_value`, and also manages the lifecycle using `std::shared_ptr`."

msgid "分配失败时向 stderr 输出错误信息并直接 `return`，不抛出异常"
msgstr "Output error information to stderr on allocation failure and directly `return`, without throwing an exception."

msgid "4.4 stream 同步策略"
msgstr "4.4 Stream Synchronization Strategy"

msgid "取决于 `TRITON_ENABLE_TASKQUEUE` 环境变量（默认 `\"true\"`）："
msgstr "Depends on the `TRITON_ENABLE_TASKQUEUE` environment variable (default `\"true\"`):"

msgid "模式"
msgstr "Mode"

msgid "行为"
msgstr "Behavior"

msgid "函数返回时机"
msgstr "The function returns when"

msgid "TaskQueue 启用（默认）"
msgstr "TaskQueue enabled (default)"

msgid "将 `rtKernelLaunch` 封装为 `std::function<rtError_t()>`，通过 `triton_async_launch` 提交到任务队列"
msgstr "Wrap `rtKernelLaunch` as `std::function<rtError_t()>`, and submit it to the task queue via `triton_async_launch`."

msgid "提交后立即返回，不等待 kernel 执行完成"
msgstr "Return immediately after submission without waiting for kernel execution to complete."

msgid "TaskQueue 禁用"
msgstr "TaskQueue disabled"

msgid "同步执行 `rtKernelLaunch`，随后调用 `rtStreamSynchronize(stream)`"
msgstr "Synchronously execute `rtKernelLaunch`, then call `rtStreamSynchronize(stream)`."

msgid "等待 kernel 执行完成后返回"
msgstr "Return after waiting for the kernel execution to complete."

