msgid "8. 限制与注意事项"
msgstr "8. Limitations and Precautions"

msgid "平台限制"
msgstr "Platform Limitations"

msgid "仅支持昇腾 NPU 平台（Atlas A2/A3 系列），不支持 GPU"
msgstr "Only supports Ascend NPU platforms (Atlas A2/A3 series), does not support GPU."

msgid "返回值与错误处理"
msgstr "Return Values and Error Handling"

msgid "函数返回类型为 `void`，**不提供稳定错误码契约**"
msgstr "The function return type is `void`, **and does not provide a stable error code contract**."

msgid "参数校验失败时静默返回（如 `num_args > 0` 但 `kernel_args` 为 `nullptr`）"
msgstr "Silently return when parameter validation fails (e.g., `num_args > 0` but `kernel_args` is `nullptr`)."

msgid "资源分配失败时向 stderr 输出错误信息并返回"
msgstr "Output error information to stderr and return when resource allocation fails."

msgid "`rtKernelLaunch` 的返回码仅在函数内部消费，不向调用方传播"
msgstr "The return code of `rtKernelLaunch` is consumed only within the function and is not propagated to the caller."

msgid "调用方若需确认 kernel 执行状态，应："
msgstr "If the caller needs to confirm the kernel execution status, they should:"

msgid "TaskQueue 禁用模式下：函数返回后 kernel 已执行完毕，通过 `rtStreamSynchronize` 等价物确认"
msgstr "In TaskQueue disabled mode: after the function returns, the kernel has completed execution, confirmed via the equivalent of `rtStreamSynchronize`."

msgid "TaskQueue 启用模式（默认）：自行跟踪任务队列状态"
msgstr "TaskQueue enabled mode (default): tracks the task queue status automatically"

msgid "ABI 稳定性"
msgstr "ABI Stability"

msgid "`triton_launch_kernel` 由 `generate_npu_wrapper_src()` 按 kernel 编译动态生成，每个 launcher stub `.so` 中的该函数其参数区内存布局可能不同"
msgstr "`triton_launch_kernel` is dynamically generated by `generate_npu_wrapper_src()` during kernel compilation, and the memory layout of the parameter area for this function may differ across each launcher stub `.so`."

msgid "布局影响因素包括：kernel signature、`metadata.workspace_size`、`metadata.lock_num`、`metadata.coalesce_factor`、`metadata.coalesce_axis`、`metadata.force_simt_only`、`TRITON_DEVICE_PRINT`、ffts 支持状态"
msgstr "Layout influencing factors include: kernel signature, `metadata.workspace_size`, `metadata.lock_num`, `metadata.coalesce_factor`, `metadata.coalesce_axis`, `metadata.force_simt_only`, `TRITON_DEVICE_PRINT`, and ffts support status."

msgid "**不同编译产物生成的 `triton_launch_kernel` 不可互换使用**；调用方应确保使用的 launcher stub `.so` 与目标 kernel 编译产物匹配"
msgstr "**`triton_launch_kernel` generated from different compilation artifacts are not interchangeable**; the caller must ensure that the launcher stub `.so` used matches the target kernel's compilation artifact."

msgid "grid 语义"
msgstr "grid semantics"

msgid "后端以 `blockNum = gridX × gridY × gridZ` 计算总 block 数，以此数量调用 `rtKernelLaunch`"
msgstr "The backend calculates the total number of blocks as `blockNum = gridX × gridY × gridZ` and calls `rtKernelLaunch` with this count."

msgid "三个 grid 值均写入 kernel 参数区的 grid 槽位，kernel 内部可通过对应偏移读取"
msgstr "The three grid values are all written into the grid slot of the kernel parameter area, and can be read from within the kernel via the corresponding offset."

msgid "当 `coalesce_factor > 1` 且 `coalesce_axis` 合法（0/1/2）时，对应轴的 grid 维度在发射前执行整数除法（`gridX = gridX / H` 等）"
msgstr "When `coalesce_factor > 1` and `coalesce_axis` is valid (0/1/2), the grid dimension of the corresponding axis performs integer division before launch (`gridX = gridX / H`, etc.)."

msgid "若启用了 `auto_map_parallel_blocks`，`blockNum` 会被钳制到 `min(blockNum, 物理核数)`"
msgstr "If `auto_map_parallel_blocks` is enabled, `blockNum` will be clamped to `min(blockNum, number of physical cores)`."

msgid "当 `blockNum` 超过物理核数且 `TRITON_GRID_WARN_PRINT=\"true\"` 时，向 stderr 输出性能警告"
msgstr "When `blockNum` exceeds the number of physical cores and `TRITON_GRID_WARN_PRINT=\"true\"`, a performance warning is output to stderr."

msgid "其他"
msgstr "Other"

msgid "`kernel_args` 深拷贝增加 `sum(arg_sizes[i])` 字节的临时内存开销"
msgstr "`kernel_args` deep copy adds `sum(arg_sizes[i])` bytes of temporary memory overhead"

msgid "`shapes_data` / `shape_dims` / `tensor_kinds` 主要用于 msprof tensor 信息上报；不传（设为 `nullptr`）不影响 kernel 正确性，但 profiler 中 tensor 信息将缺失"
msgstr "`shapes_data` / `shape_dims` / `tensor_kinds` are mainly used for msprof tensor information reporting; not passing them (setting to `nullptr`) does not affect kernel correctness, but tensor information in the profiler will be missing."

msgid "该接口生成的代码依赖 CANN 运行时版本，升级 CANN 后需重新编译 launcher stub"
msgstr "The code generated by this interface depends on the CANN runtime version. After upgrading CANN, the launcher stub must be recompiled."
